    "source": "Project Gutenberg #10800",
    "text": "Materia Melancholiae aliquando in corde, in stomacho, hepate, ab hypocondriis, myruche, splene, cum ibi romanet humor melancholicus."
  },
  "1.2.5.2-r10": {
